OL,3,GNEWSACharity connects young people with
OL,4,Aprofessionals
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new initiative is giving young people
OL,7,Fin Cornwall the chance to gain access
OL,8,Fto places and experiences that would
OL,9,Fotherwise be "out of reach".
OL,11,FThe Lord Lieutenant Fund at charity
OL,12,FYoung and Talented Cornwall said the
OL,13,Flaunch would help them build confidence
OL,14,Fand broaden their horizons.
OL,16,FIt follows the successful pilot of
OL,17,FCatalyst, a scheme which had connected
OL,18,Ffive young people with leading
OL,19,Fprofessionals and practitioners which
OL,20,Fcreated "highly personalised
OL,21,Fopportunities" designed around their
OL,22,Findividual talents and ambitions.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
