OL,3,GNEWSACharity connects young people with
OL,4,Aprofessionals
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new programme is supported by
OL,7,FCornish Metals and its CEO Col Sir
OL,8,FEdward Bolitho KCVO OBE said the county
OL,9,Fhad an "incredible wealth of young
OL,10,Ftalent".
